{"text":"孝昌二年二月八日，周天蓋仰為父母、師僧、一切眾生，敬造無量壽像一軀。願出至天鄉，三有群少同津法澤，普登正覺。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"周天蓋","refId":null,"text":"周天蓋","start":9,"end":12},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"眾生","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量壽","refId":null,"text":"無量壽","start":27,"end":30},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三界","refId":null,"text":"三有","start":40,"end":42},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法雨","refId":null,"text":"法澤","start":46,"end":48},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":51,"end":53}]}